Training data: Reshumot (laws and regulations)
----------------------------------------------

Training lines were rendered by HeOCR (pdftoppm, 150 dpi grey) from 48
born-digital PDF booklets of ספר החוקים (Sefer ha-Hukim, 12,602 lines) and
קובץ התקנות (Kovetz ha-Takanot, 6,931 lines), published 2006-2026 by
Reshumot (רשומות), the official gazette of the State of Israel. Each line is
labelled with the publisher's own PDF text layer for that line. Laws and
regulations carry no copyright in Israel (Copyright Act 2007, section 6;
PD-IL). Their status outside Israel, including the United States, is not
asserted here. Every booklet passed HeOCR's born-digital check and its
evaluation-reserve guard: none is an evaluation booklet. The booklet
numbers, publisher URLs and PDF sha256 values are in r8b_training_run.json.

